            "file": "Haven.wgt",
            "name": "Haven",
            "description": "Home Assistant powered home screen: sensors, lights and scenes by room, weather, live cameras, a Jellyfin client and music from Home Assistant\u0027s media folder. Your Home Assistant address and token are written into the package on install.",
            "category": "other",
